      "type": "Installation",
      "category": "planting",
      "notes": "Three-day installation in December 2025. Five structural layers planted across the full garden: canopy trees (Olive, Jacaranda, October Glory Maple, Gleditsia), an evergreen shrub layer (Westringia, Rosemary, Echium, Euphorbia, Smokebush), mid-level perennials and grasses (Miscanthus, Karl Foerster, Gaura, Salvia, Limonium, Anemone, Billy Buttons), and a living ground layer of Native Violet, Dichondra and Pratia anchored by Stachys. Arborist mulch applied throughout. Garden now establishing."
